06:29:40,066 --> 06:29:43,706
What that means is that there are two self-referential

3466
06:29:43,746 --> 06:29:47,726
relationships for material. One is, "I am part

3467
06:29:47,786 --> 06:29:48,906
of something bigger"

3468
06:29:49,766 --> 06:29:53,546
and is part of relationship, and the other is, "I was taken

3469
06:29:53,626 --> 06:29:56,906
from and I'm no longer physically connected with

3470
06:29:57,346 --> 06:29:58,066
something else."

3471
06:29:59,106 --> 06:30:03,026
So, derived from relationship, and both of those exist in the model,

3472
06:30:03,526 --> 06:30:07,326
both conceptually and in practice in Darwin Core data package.

3473
06:30:10,746 --> 06:30:14,706
If we want to start to put this in a bigger context, then

3474
06:30:15,146 --> 06:30:18,625
material entities, most of us are used to collecting

3475
06:30:18,706 --> 06:30:21,486
