3482
06:30:43,126 --> 06:30:46,526
So, we're not talking only about collections and occurrences here.

3483
06:30:46,546 --> 06:30:50,526
We're talking about all the things that material can engage in, all the things

3484
06:30:50,566 --> 06:30:54,106
