3488
06:31:04,926 --> 06:31:08,906
Then we put it into yet a bigger picture, the one that we started with in our world

3489
06:31:08,946 --> 06:31:12,266
when we created Darwin Core and ABCD, which is to try and

3490
06:31:12,346 --> 06:31:16,126
