3491
06:31:16,246 --> 06:31:19,146
of what it means in the bigger world and where

3492
06:31:21,266 --> 06:31:24,606
organisms occur. So, here we're connecting it to occurrences

3493
06:31:25,526 --> 06:31:29,386
and to the identifications of those things or determinations of those things

3494
06:31:29,446 --> 06:31:31,606
to some taxon or taxonomic concept.

3495
06:31:32,126 --> 06:31:35,346
So, an identification fits into the model as being

3496
06:31:36,146 --> 06:31:39,966
of a material entity, a specimen, or

3497
06:31:40,046 --> 06:31:43,546
