5247
08:49:13,316 --> 08:49:16,936
The goal would be to assess current higher geography terms,

5248
08:49:17,976 --> 08:49:21,796
maybe look at the difference in terms that are available for sharing human versus

5249
08:49:21,836 --> 08:49:22,856
physical geography,

5250
08:49:23,936 --> 08:49:26,996
blanket make suggestions for additions or modifications,

5251
08:49:27,936 --> 08:49:31,276
look at recommendations for when to use controlled vocabulary concepts.

5252
08:49:31,516 --> 08:49:34,456
How do we take advantage of work being done by the Geo Schemes group?

5253
08:49:34,916 --> 08:49:36,536
Encourage the use of IRI terms.

5254
08:49:37,356 --> 08:49:40,956
Not sure. Anyway, this talk is basically a plug

5255
08:49:41,036 --> 08:49:44,576
for if you are interested, please send Teresa and I an

5256
08:49:44,676 --> 08:49:48,656
email, and we would be willing to convene a group if we got enough

5257
08:49:48,716 --> 08:49:52,636
interest. Otherwise, in the meantime, we'll just keep complaining about

5258
08:49:52,676 --> 08:49:54,496
higher geography. Thank you.

